  ('2d413b88-f65a-425a-ab74-ac0e00f1b10a', 'f4c24128-d88e-4a62-a49d-eb3c497bc69d', 'availability', 'Availability reply', 'Hi {{guest}}! Thanks for your interest in {{business}}. {{property}} is available from {{checkIn}} to {{checkOut}} ({{nights}} nights) at {{total}} in total. Would you like us to hold the dates for you? A {{deposit}} deposit secures the booking.'),
