  ('d4bd6804-00f4-4598-aff0-e45da8c7249d', '9f881307-c796-4ac4-a4bc-2a5a2119edae', 'availability', 'Availability reply', 'Hi {{guest}}! Thanks for your interest in {{business}}. {{property}} is available from {{checkIn}} to {{checkOut}} ({{nights}} nights) at {{total}} in total. Would you like us to hold the dates for you? A {{deposit}} deposit secures the booking.'),
